8/section/145">The Copyright Tribunal.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/146">146.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/146">Membership of the Tribunal.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/147">147.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/147">Financial provisions.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/148">148.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/148">Constitution for purposes of proceedings.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/part/I/chapter/VIII/crossheading/jurisdiction-and-procedure">Jurisdiction and procedure</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/149">149.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/149">Jurisdiction of the Tribunal.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/150">150.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/150">General power to make rules.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/151">151.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1988/48/section/151">Costs, proof of orders, &amp;c.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem Leg